_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十三、西宁卫（卷六十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"胡氏曰：赤海，赤水深广处。唐时有黑党项居赤水西，是也。去...","context_before":"...谷浑于牛心堆，又败之于赤水源。别将薛万均等又败之于赤海。","source_end_index":95,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"35692d3d-f629-5701-96f5-e56ab8e37a81","source_start_index":69,"source_text":"麟德二年，吐蕃攻夺吐谷浑地，遣使入见，求赤水地畜牧。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/十三、西宁卫（卷六十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["外交"],"content":"1春，正月，丁卯，吐蕃遣使入見，請復與吐谷渾和親，仍求赤水地畜牧，上不許。","content_fanyi":"春季，正月二十四日丁卯，吐蕃派遣使者入宫朝见高宗，请求再与吐谷浑和好结亲，还要求把原属吐谷浑的赤水地区划给他们畜牧，高宗没有答应。","content_jianti_auto":"1春，正月，丁卯，吐蕃遣使入见，请复与吐谷浑和亲，仍求赤水地畜牧，上不许。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":19719,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b99d9eef-db0e-11ef-85ad-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"京師","place_name_jianti_auto":"京师","resolved_place_entity_id":43,"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b99d9ef9-db0e-11ef-9b4d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"合璧宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"合璧宫","place_note":"洛阳境","resolved_place_entity_id":2384,"start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b99d9efa-db0e-11ef-896f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"2二月，壬午，車駕發京師；丁酉，至合璧宮。","content_fanyi":"二月壬午日，即初十，高宗的车驾从京师长安出发；二月丁酉日，即二十五日，到达合璧宫。","content_jianti_auto":"2二月，壬午，车驾发京师；丁酉，至合璧宫。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":19720,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"b99d9ef8-db0e-11ef-998a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"褚遂良","people_name_jianti_auto":"褚遂良","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b99d9efd-db0e-11ef-9b7b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"韓瑗","people_name_jianti_auto":"韩瑗","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b99d9efe-db0e-11ef-a64d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李勣","people_name_jianti_auto":"李𪟝","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"b99d9eff-db0e-11ef-8b64-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"褚遂良、韓瑗之死，不唯拒諫，且殺諫者矣，羣臣誰敢復諫乎！李勣獻諛以苟祿利，而不知凶于其家。","note_content_jianti_auto":"褚遂良、韩瑗之死，不唯拒谏，且杀谏者矣，群臣谁敢复谏乎！李𪟝献谀以苟禄利，而不知凶于其家。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"b99d9efc-db0e-11ef-b281-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"侍臣","official_note":"侍臣泛指在皇帝身边侍奉的近臣，可能包括侍中、侍郎等官职，此处用于指代唐高宗身边的官员，表示皇帝在向近臣发表言论。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"謂侍臣曰","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"eb9b90e9-55b6-431a-ab16-2f5f6b5aa2b4"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":569,"link_death_year":618,"link_td_description":"隋炀帝杨广，又名英，小字阿𡡉，隋文帝杨坚和文献皇后独孤伽罗的次子，唐高祖的表弟，是隋朝第二位皇帝。","link_td_id":"Q10000040","link_td_number_id":31136,"people_name":"隋煬帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"隋炀帝","people_xingming":"隋炀帝","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b99d9f00-db0e-11ef-8fa1-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":569,"link_death_year":618,"link_td_description":"隋炀帝杨广，又名英，小字阿𡡉，隋文帝杨坚和文献皇后独孤伽罗的次子，唐高祖的表弟，是隋朝第二位皇帝。","link_td_id":"Q10000040","link_td_number_id":31136,"people_name":"煬帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"炀帝","people_xingming":"隋炀帝","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b99d9f01-db0e-11ef-b68b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"李勣","people_name_jianti_auto":"李𪟝","people_xingming":"李勣","start_index":42,"tongjian_id":"b99d9f02-db0e-11ef-9803-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政","人事"],"content":"3上語及隋煬帝，謂侍臣曰：「煬帝拒諫而亡，朕常以爲戒，虛心求諫；而竟無諫者，何也？」李勣對曰：「陛下所爲盡善，羣臣無得而諫。」","content_fanyi":"唐高宗谈到隋炀帝，对左右侍臣说：“炀帝拒绝劝谏而灭亡，我常常引以为戒，虚心求取谏言；可是竟然没有进谏的人，这是为什么呢？”李勣回答说：“陛下的所作所为尽善尽美，群臣没有什么可进谏的。”","content_jianti_auto":"3上语及隋炀帝，谓侍臣曰：「炀帝拒谏而亡，朕常以为戒，虚心求谏；而竟无谏者，何也？」李𪟝对曰：「陛下所为尽善，群臣无得而谏。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，知高宗之不以己为佞也。则以党义府、敬宗，赞立武氏，人自...","context_before":"...可知，姑为两试，抑知太宗之不以此为嫌也；年愈老，智愈猾，","source_end_index":90,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"dc9b6f3c-df13-4e8b-8a06-c28cdac240a2","source_start_index":68,"source_text":"高宗问以群臣不谏，而曰“所为尽善，无得而谏”"}],"title":"七 李世勣的忠孝两端"}],"id":19721,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"b99d9efb-db0e-11ef-b1fb-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"姜寶誼","people_name_jianti_auto":"姜宝谊","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b99d9f05-db0e-11ef-964d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"高祖","people_name_jianti_auto":"高祖","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"b99d9f06-db0e-11ef-8be2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"太原","place_name_jianti_auto":"太原","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"b99d9f07-db0e-11ef-a8bc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"司戎太常伯，卽兵部尚書。姜寶誼從高祖起兵於太原。","note_content_jianti_auto":"司戎太常伯，即兵部尚书。姜宝谊从高祖起兵于太原。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"b99d9f04-db0e-11ef-b775-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"司戎太常伯","official_note":"司戎太常伯是唐代官职，属于兵部系统，负责军事事务。在《资治通鉴》此段中，姜恪以兼司戎太常伯的身份被任命，表明他担任军事相关职务。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"兼司戎太常伯","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"04228d04-0826-4132-9724-8a778cc93b6b"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"同東西臺三品","official_note":"同東西臺三品是唐代官职，指以同中书门下三品的身份参与中枢决策，相当于宰相级别。在《资治通鉴》此段中，姜恪被任命为此职，表示他进入朝廷核心权力机构。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"同東西臺三品","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"994eafab-96e4-470f-8c95-03a00ec37a77"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":672,"link_td_description":"姜恪，秦州上邽（今甘肃天水）人。姜维后裔，祖父姜远曾为秦州刺史。父姜宝谊为左卫大将军。唐高宗永徽年间姜恪因战功升为左相，阎立本因善绘事而为右相，时人评论说：“左相宣威沙漠，右相驰誉丹青。”姜恪过世时爵位为永安县公，应是承袭自其父，但谥号无载。孙姜知友。","link_td_id":"Q10010064","link_td_number_id":945607,"people_name":"姜恪","people_name_jianti_auto":"姜恪","people_xingming":"姜恪","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b99d9f08-db0e-11ef-8521-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":672,"link_td_description":"姜恪，秦州上邽（今甘肃天水）人。姜维后裔，祖父姜远曾为秦州刺史。父姜宝谊为左卫大将军。唐高宗永徽年间姜恪因战功升为左相，阎立本因善绘事而为右相，时人评论说：“左相宣威沙漠，右相驰誉丹青。”姜恪过世时爵位为永安县公，应是承袭自其父，但谥号无载。孙姜知友。","link_td_id":"Q10010064","link_td_number_id":945607,"people_name":"恪","people_name_jianti_auto":"恪","people_xingming":"姜恪","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"b99d9f09-db0e-11ef-8519-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":619,"link_td_description":"姜宝谊，秦州上邽（今甘肃天水）人，三国蜀汉名将姜维后人，唐朝右武卫大将军，谥刚。","link_td_id":"Q10010062","link_td_number_id":945610,"people_name":"寶誼","people_name_jianti_auto":"宝谊","people_xingming":"姜宝谊","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"b99d9f0a-db0e-11ef-9241-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"4三月，甲寅，以兼司戎太常伯姜恪同東西臺三品。恪，寶誼之子也。","content_fanyi":"三月十二日甲寅，朝廷任命兼任司戎太常伯的姜恪为同东西台三品。姜恪，是姜宝谊的儿子。","content_jianti_auto":"4三月，甲寅，以兼司戎太常伯姜恪同东西台三品。恪，宝谊之子也。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":19722,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b99d9f03-db0e-11ef-85ff-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions