ion":"张公艺，中国唐代郓州寿张县（今山东阳谷县或河南台前县）人。九代同堂，家族九百余人，北齐、北周、隋、唐各朝都对他家予以表彰。","link_td_id":"Q10011472","link_td_number_id":1264035,"people_name":"公藝","people_name_jianti_auto":"公艺","people_xingming":"张公艺","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"b99fe931-db0e-11ef-8355-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"壽張","place_name_jianti_auto":"寿张","place_note":"山东省梁山县西北寿张集","resolved_place_entity_id":1440,"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b99fe930-db0e-11ef-bc4c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","resolved_place_entity_id":26,"start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"b99fe932-db0e-11ef-a2eb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","resolved_place_entity_id":139,"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b99fe933-db0e-11ef-857a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","resolved_place_entity_id":44,"start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"b99fe934-db0e-11ef-aae6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"壽張","place_name_jianti_auto":"寿张","resolved_place_entity_id":1440,"start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"b99fe935-db0e-11ef-8b20-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"壽張人張公藝九世同居，齊、隋、唐皆旌表其門。上過壽張，幸其宅，問所以能共居之故，公藝書「忍」字百餘以進。上善之，賜以縑帛。","content_fanyi":"寿张人张公艺一家九代同居，北齐、隋、唐都曾在他家门前赐匾额表彰。高宗经过寿张，亲临他的住宅，问他家能够九代共同居住的原因，张公艺书写一百多个“忍”字呈进给皇帝。皇帝对此很赞赏，赐给他缣帛。","content_jianti_auto":"寿张人张公艺九世同居，齐、隋、唐皆旌表其门。上过寿张，幸其宅，问所以能共居之故，公艺书「忍」字百余以进。上善之，赐以缣帛。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，论者谓其无当于高宗之失，而增其柔懦，亦恶知忍之为道乎！...","context_before":"","source_end_index":12,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"438a7e06-00ff-4c3e-8933-d2a2bd53afbc","source_start_index":0,"source_text":"张公艺以百“忍”字献高宗"}],"title":"四 高宗被悍妇胁内不能忍"}],"id":19732,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b99fe922-db0e-11ef-9e71-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊州","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐州","place_note":"山东省济南市","resolved_place_entity_id":27,"start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b99fe937-db0e-11ef-96e8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"靈巖頓","place_name_jianti_auto":"灵岩顿","place_note":"山东省长清县东南","resolved_place_entity_id":9757,"start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"b99fe938-db0e-11ef-8149-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"泰山","place_name_jianti_auto":"泰山","resolved_place_entity_id":306,"start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"b99fe939-db0e-11ef-8800-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"社首山","place_name_jianti_auto":"社首山","place_note":"山东省泰安市西南一公里","resolved_place_entity_id":2945,"start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"b99fe93a-db0e-11ef-86f2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、济南府（卷三十一）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"《金史》：灵岩寺有屋三百余间，且连接泰安之天圣寨，介于东...","context_before":"...十道图》以润之栖霞，台之国清，荆之玉泉，与此为四绝者也。","source_end_index":124,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"a9a9b4ce-1f70-5706-b215-85f26ce9af5e","source_start_index":104,"source_text":"《唐书》：麟德二年，发灵岩顿，至泰山下。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/一、济南府（卷三十一）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"十二月，丙午，車駕至齊州，留十日。丙辰，發靈巖頓，至泰山下，有司於山南爲圓壇，山上爲登封壇，社首山上爲降禪方壇。","content_fanyi":"十二月初九日丙午，皇帝抵达齐州，停留十天。十二月十九日丙辰，从灵岩顿启程，来到泰山脚下，有关部门在泰山南面修筑圆坛，在山上修筑登封祭天坛，在社首山上修筑降禅祭地祇的方坛。","content_jianti_auto":"十二月，丙午，车驾至齐州，留十日。丙辰，发灵岩顿，至泰山下，有司于山南为圆坛，山上为登封坛，社首山上为降禅方坛。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":19733,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b99fe936-db0e-11ef-b758-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"二年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"二年","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b99d9eed-db0e-11ef-bca3-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（乙丑、六六五）","year_int":665},"message":"success","success":true}